# GitHub's secret-scanning push protection blocks any commit containing a
# live API key, even on private repos — so this ships with GROQ_API_KEY empty.
# The AI Analyst already has a designed fallback for exactly this: with no
# key, it serves the same rule-based explanations the rest of the app uses,
# instead of Groq-generated prose. Nothing breaks; one feature is slightly
# less flashy until you optionally paste in your own key below.
GROQ_API_KEY=
GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile
